# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SpillTrace — what stays out of git
#
# The repository is the *product*: code, the trained model, the demo case and its
# preview images. The ~91 GB of Sentinel-1 source rasters stay on local disk. A
# clone can run the full dashboard and the whole test suite; it cannot retrain
# without downloading the dataset. See README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# -- the datasets (about 91 GB) ---------------------------------------------
# Sentinel-1 GeoTIFF scenes and their masks, and the archives they arrived in.
/Oil/
/Mask_oil/
*.7z
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# Ocean forcing. The CMEMS NetCDF is ~370 MB and re-downloadable from Copernicus.
*.nc
*.nc4
/data/raw/

# -- generated intermediates -------------------------------------------------
# Patch cache: ~242 MB of .npz rebuilt by scripts/run_preprocess.py. Two of the
# three files are over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit on their own.
/data/processed/cache/

# -- the virtualenv ----------------------------------------------------------
# Recreate with: python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
.venv/
venv/
env/

# -- python noise ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
build/
# NOTE: not `dist/` — apps/web's offline bundle lives there and is committed
# deliberately, as the demo's hot spare on port 8787.

# -- editors and operating systems -------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately committed, despite being generated. Listed here so nobody
# "tidies" them away later:
#
#   models/unet_vv_vh.npz          7.3 MB  — the trained model. No model, no demo.
#   data/processed/previews/       8.6 MB  — the PNGs the API serves to the
#                                            dashboard. Without these the
#                                            imagery screens render nothing.
#   data/processed/cases/          1.9 MB  — the two stored cases, incl. `demo`.
#   data/processed/*.json          ~3.3 MB — audit, splits, metrics, patch index.
#   dist/                          3.3 MB  — offline static bundle.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
